  <h2>Using visual references</h2>
  <p>Factory illustrations are labeled as Volvo material and linked to their source. Original diagrams on this site are marked conceptual. Generic photographs are used only to show general component appearance, never as proof of exact S60 fitment or component location.</p>
  <p>When adding photographs of an individual car, include the view, component, model-year applicability, and whether the image shows the actual vehicle or a reference example. Avoid publishing the VIN, registration plate, home address, or other identifying details.</p>
